# files of eight columns, where the first value of a row is skipped with the run call: an invalid first value at row
# 9, a quoted one at row 17, an invalid byte in the fifth column at row 21, a valid non ASCII first value at row 25;
# with a comma, with a two byte delimiter and with comment lines. And a single column file of 200 rows, where the
# value ends at the row end: invalid values at rows 7 and 150, an invalid quoted one at row 30.

